nthesis</h1></header><h2 id=3D"introduction">Introduction</h2>
<p>Generative AI offers a fascinating ability to create highly realistic an=
d diverse images. In this chapter, we explore a technique that enables the =
generation of detailed and varied images in just seconds.</p>
