<h2 id=3D"clarifying-requirements">Clarifying Requirements</h2>
<p>Here is a typical interaction between a candidate and an interviewer:</p=
>
<p><strong>Candidate</strong>: Should the system focus on specific categori=
es of images at the start?<br>
<strong>Interviewer</strong>: For simplicity, let's begin with natural scen=
es and urban landscapes. We can explore other categories later.</p>
<p><strong>Candidate</strong>: Do we have training data consisting of natur=
