<h2 id=3D"frame-the-problem-as-an-ml-task">Frame the Problem as an ML Task<=
/h2>
<h3 id=3D"specifying-the-systems-input-and-output">Specifying the system=E2=
=80=99s input and output</h3>
<p>For high-resolution image synthesis, the user simply requests a new imag=
e. The output is a high-resolution image.</p>
