<p>In summary, we approach image generation with a Transformer-based autore=
gressive model. First, an image generator (decoder-only Transformer) genera=
tes a sequence of discrete tokens. Then, an image tokenizer decodes these t=
okens into the final image. We will explore the architecture, training, and=
 sampling processes of these components in detail in the model development =
section.</p>
